OL,3,GNEWSATwenty-seven people trapped on
OL,4,Arollercoaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters are attempting to rescue
OL,7,F27 people from a theme park
OL,8,Frollercoaster.
OL,10,FSuffolk Fire and Rescue Service said it
OL,11,Fwas called to Pleasurewood Hills in
OL,12,FLowestoft at 13:36 BST.
OL,14,FA spokesperson said the carriages of
OL,15,Fthe Wipeout ride came to a stop on the
OL,16,Ftrack, while approximately 15m (49ft)
OL,17,Fin the air, "but not upside down".
OL,19,FCrews would use advanced
OL,20,Frescue-at-height equipment, they said.
OL,21,FThe park has been approached for
OL,22,Fcomment.
